<body>
  <p class=""updated"">Last updated: 4 October 2026</p>

  <p>These Terms &amp; Conditions (""Terms"") apply to your use of the Yogmaya apps and the services offered through them. By ticking the box below and continuing, you agree to these Terms.</p>

  <h2><span>1.</span>Who can use the app</h2>
  <p>You must be at least 18 years old. If you ride, you must hold any licence needed for the vehicle assigned to you. The details you give us, including your name, mobile number and documents, must be accurate and kept up to date.</p>

  <h2><span>2.</span>Your account</h2>
  <p>You sign in with your mobile number and a one-time password. Keep your phone secure and never share your codes with anyone. You are responsible for all activity on your account.</p>

  <h2><span>3.</span>Vehicles and equipment</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use vehicles safely and follow all traffic laws.</li>
    <li>Do not lend, sublet or modify a vehicle, its battery or its connected device.</li>
    <li>Report damage, theft or breakdowns through the app as soon as possible.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2><span>4.</span>Rentals, deposits and payments</h2>
  <p>Rent, deposits and fees follow the plan shown in the app. Deposits are refunded after the vehicle is returned and inspected, less any amounts owed for damage or unpaid dues.</p>

  <h2><span>5.</span>Location and vehicle data</h2>
  <p>We collect location, ride and vehicle data to run the service, keep riders and vehicles safe, and provide support. Our Privacy Policy explains how this data is used and protected.</p>

  <h2><span>6.</span>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Do not use the app for anything unlawful, interfere with how it works, or submit information that is false or belongs to someone else.</p>

  <h2><span>7.</span>Suspension and termination</h2>
  <p>We may suspend or close an account that breaks these Terms. You can stop using the service at any time once any vehicle in your care has been returned and your dues are settled.</p>

  <h2><span>8.</span>Liability</h2>
  <p>The app is provided as available. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect or consequential losses. Nothing in these Terms limits rights you have under applicable law.</p>

  <h2><span>9.</span>Changes to these Terms</h2>
  <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. We will tell you about significant changes in the app, and continuing to use the service means you accept the updated Terms.</p>

  <h2><span>10.</span>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India.</p>

  <h2><span>11.</span>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these Terms? Contact your fleet operator or the Yogmaya team.</p>
</body>
</html>
