<html lang=""kn""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><meta name=""viewport"" content=""width=device-width, initial-scale=1"">
<title>ಗೌಪ್ಯತಾ ಸೂಚನೆ ಮತ್ತು ಸಮ್ಮತಿ ನಮೂನೆ</title><style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; --text: #11202f; --secondary: #5b6b7c; --muted: #8b9aaa; --accent: #f475d0; --wash: #fdecf8; --ink: #3d0a2c; }
