<body><p role=""note"" class=""legal-translation-review"">[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: English placeholder for Gujarati (gu). Translate this entire document and verify client details before publication.]</p>
<main>
  <h1>Fleet Manager Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
  <p class=""meta"">EVsEye Fleet Manager App | Fleet operator: EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD<br>Draft version: 1.0.0 | Effective date: to be assigned at publication</p>
  <p class=""notice""><strong>[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: Confirm client legal name, contacts, authority and escalation rules, enabled financial actions, and legal approval before publication.]</strong></p>
  <h2>1. Who these terms apply to</h2>
  <p>These terms govern access to the EVsEye Fleet Manager App by an individual authorised by EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD to manage its fleet operations. “EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD” means the fleet operator identified in the applicable employment or service arrangement. “EV Spares” means EV Spares India Pvt Ltd, which provides the EVsEye platform. “You” means the authorised Fleet Manager. These terms govern use of the App; your employment, compensation, and authority to act for EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD are governed by your separate arrangement with EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD.</p>
  <h2>2. Account and authority</h2>
  <p>Use only the account assigned to you. Keep your phone, OTPs, and access credentials secure; do not share them or allow another person to work under your identity. Your access is limited to the locations, riders, vehicles, and actions assigned by EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD. Inform EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD promptly if your device, account, or credentials are lost or compromised. EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD may change your role or withdraw access when your duties change.</p>
  <h2>3. Operational records and decisions</h2>
  <p>Enter accurate, timely information about rider onboarding, identity and document review, vehicle inspection, allocation, handover, return, incidents, maintenance, and other enabled workflows. Check original evidence where EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD's procedure requires it. Do not approve, reject, change, or delete a record without a legitimate operational reason. Record the reason for significant decisions when the App asks for one. A status shown by the App is an operational record, not a substitute for any required physical check, signed agreement, or legal approval.</p>
  <h2>4. Vehicles, riders, and safety</h2>
  <p>Follow EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD's safety, inspection, allocation, and escalation procedures. Do not release an unsafe or ineligible vehicle, override a failed check, or knowingly allocate a vehicle to a person who has not met applicable requirements. Report accidents, theft, damage, battery issues, breakdowns, and suspected misuse promptly through the designated process. Use rider and vehicle information only to carry out authorised duties.</p>
  <h2>5. Documents, photographs, and verification</h2>
  <p>Upload only relevant and genuine documents and photographs. Do not alter evidence to misrepresent its content. Where the App offers third-party verification, treat the result as one part of the applicable review process and follow EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD's procedure for exceptions. Do not download, copy, forward, or store rider identity documents outside approved systems unless EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD expressly authorises it and a lawful purpose requires it.</p>
  <h2>6. Payments and financial records</h2>
  <p>If your role includes deposits, rent, refunds, wallet adjustments, or invoices, enter transactions accurately and use only approved payment channels. Do not request payment to a personal account, promise an undisclosed fee waiver, or make an unapproved adjustment. The App may record who performed an action and when. Any authority to collect or approve money comes from EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD's separate policy and assigned permissions.</p>
  <h2>7. Confidentiality and personal information</h2>
  <p>Rider, staff, vehicle, financial, and business information visible in the App is confidential. Access only records needed for your assigned work; do not use them for personal purposes or share them with unauthorised people. Follow EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD's privacy and data-handling instructions and the Fleet Manager Privacy Policy presented separately in the App. Report an accidental disclosure or suspected data incident promptly. This clause does not prevent a disclosure required by law or a protected report to a competent authority.</p>
  <h2>8. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Do not impersonate another user, submit false information, manipulate location or vehicle data, bypass permissions, probe the service for vulnerabilities, introduce harmful software, or use the App for harassment or unlawful activity. Do not use automated access or extract bulk records without written authorisation. Use App features only for the purposes made available to your role.</p>
  <h2>9. Availability and changes</h2>
  <p>Features depend on EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD's configuration and may change as its operations change. Connectivity, device, and third-party failures can interrupt access. Keep an appropriate manual escalation route for urgent safety decisions. Material changes to these terms will be presented for acceptance when required; the App records the version and time accepted.</p>
  <h2>10. Suspension and end of access</h2>
  <p>EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD may suspend or end your access because of a role change, security concern, suspected misuse, or the end of your arrangement with EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD. Return company devices and records and stop using copied information when access ends, subject to lawful retention and reporting obligations. Suspected wrongdoing should be reviewed under EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD's applicable process; an App restriction alone is not a final employment decision.</p>
  <h2>11. Responsibility and disputes</h2>
  <p>These terms do not remove rights or obligations that cannot legally be excluded. Your separate agreement with EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD controls employment or service matters. Indian law applies to these App terms, subject to mandatory law and the jurisdiction of legally competent courts or tribunals. Concerns about fleet operations should first be raised with EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD; platform access or technical concerns may be raised with EV Spares.</p>
  <h2>12. Contacts</h2>
  <p>EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD fleet operations: <strong>[confirm legal name, postal address, authorised email, and support phone before publication]</strong>.</p>
  <p>EV Spares platform support: <strong>office@evsparesindia.com</strong>.</p>
  <p>Notices may be sent through the App or to a contact address you provide, subject to applicable law.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
