<body><p role=""note"" class=""legal-translation-review"">[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: English placeholder for Malayalam (ml). Translate this entire document and verify client details before publication.]</p>
<main>
  <h1>Fleet Manager Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class=""meta"">EVsEye Fleet Manager App | Fleet operator: EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD<br>Draft version: 1.0.0 | Effective date: to be assigned at publication</p>
  <p class=""notice""><strong>[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: Confirm data categories, purposes, providers, retention, contacts, and legal approval before publication.]</strong></p>
  <h2>1. Who uses the information</h2>
  <p>EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD decides how Fleet Manager account and operational information is used to assign work, supervise fleet activity, review rider and vehicle records, and handle incidents. EV Spares India Pvt Ltd operates the EVsEye platform and decides how platform security, technical support, and service diagnostics information is used. <strong>[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm this division of responsibility and the contact for each organisation.]</strong></p>
  <h2>2. Information handled in the App</h2>
  <p>The App may handle the Fleet Manager's registered mobile number, name, role, assigned hubs, authentication and device security records, actions taken in operational workflows, notes, documents or photographs the manager submits, support requests, and audit records. The manager may also view rider, vehicle, payment, and verification information within assigned permissions. <strong>[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm which of these categories are live, whether phone location or camera access is used, and whether any further information is collected.]</strong></p>
  <h2>3. Why it is used</h2>
  <p>Information is used to authenticate the manager, apply assigned permissions, show relevant work, record and audit operational decisions, coordinate fleet and rider operations, investigate incidents, secure the platform, and provide support. Access to rider information must be limited to authorised work. <strong>[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm each actual purpose and its applicable legal basis before publication.]</strong></p>
  <h2>4. Sharing and service providers</h2>
  <p>Authorised EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD personnel and authorised EV Spares support personnel may access records according to their responsibilities. Service providers may process limited information to deliver hosting, authentication messages, document storage, or operational services. <strong>[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: list the live cloud region, SMS/email, maps, payments, verification, analytics, and support providers; identify any processing or access outside India.]</strong></p>
  <h2>5. Retention and security</h2>
  <p>Access is restricted by role and the platform records significant actions. EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD and EV Spares apply technical and organisational controls to protect information. Records are retained according to the approved category-specific schedule and legal requirements. <strong>[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: state actual retention periods and deletion triggers for account, access, audit, operational, uploaded evidence, payment, and support records; verify the deletion process.]</strong></p>
  <h2>6. Choices, requests, and concerns</h2>
  <p>A Fleet Manager can ask the relevant organisation about access, correction, or other requests concerning their own information through the contacts below. Operational records may need to remain accurate and available where required for legitimate operations or law. <strong>[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm request channels, grievance contact, and response process.]</strong></p>
  <h2>7. Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>Material updates will be published as a new dated version in the App. EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD privacy contact: <strong>[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: name, email, and postal address]</strong>. EV Spares platform contact: <strong>office@evsparesindia.com</strong>. Contact details and the effective date must be verified before publication.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
