e4fabbea-0c52-4485-bd06-58f55d6d9c28,RIDER,RIDER,PRIVACY_CONSENT,en,1.0.0,Privacy Notice cum Consent Form,"<!doctype html>
<html lang=""en"">
<head>
  <meta charset=""utf-8"">
  <meta name=""viewport"" content=""width=device-width, initial-scale=1"">
  <title>Rider Privacy Notice and Consent</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; --text: #11202f; --secondary: #5b6b7c; --muted: #8b9aaa; --accent: #f475d0; --wash: #fdecf8; --ink: #3d0a2c; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    body { margin: 0; background: #fff; color: var(--secondary); font: 15px/1.6 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ""Segoe UI"", Roboto, ""Helvetica Neue"", Arial, sans-serif; }
    main { width: 100%; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 18px 28px; }
    .hero { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--text); font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.3; }
    h2 { margin: 26px 0 8px; color: var(--text); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.35; }
    p, ul { margin: 0 0 13px; }
    ul { padding-left: 20px; }
    li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
    strong { color: var(--text); }
    .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    a { color: #b63891; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .callout { margin-top: 24px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--wash); color: var(--ink); }
    .callout h2 { margin-top: 0; }
    @media (max-width: 380px) { main { padding: 16px 14px 24px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <header class=""hero"">
    <p class=""eyebrow"">Before you continue</p>
    <h1>Privacy Notice cum Consent Form</h1>
    <p>Consent form for collection of personal data under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023.</p>
    <p class=""muted"">[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm the data fiduciary, DPO contact, each data category, source and sharing purpose before publishing.]</p>
  </header>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""purpose"">
    <h2 id=""purpose"">Purpose of data collection</h2>
    <p>To onboard riders on the platform of {{CLIENT_LEGAL_NAME}} to avail its services and to facilitate subsequent transactions.</p>
  </section>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""details"">
    <h2 id=""details"">Types of data collected</h2>
    <p>{{CLIENT_LEGAL_NAME}} will collect the following personal data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Identification information (PAN, name, father name and date of birth).</li>
      <li>One proof of address (Aadhaar, driving licence, passport or another officially valid document).</li>
      <li>Contact information (email address and phone number).</li>
      <li>Financial information (net worth or income statement), if applicable. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm whether this is collected.]</li>
      <li>Credit information data. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm whether this is collected and name the relevant purpose.]</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""sources"">
    <h2 id=""sources"">Sources of data collection</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>NSDL. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: verify that NSDL is a live source.]</li>
      <li>Databases maintained by government, statutory or regulatory authorities. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: identify applicable sources.]</li>
      <li>The onboarding entity or user.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""sharing"">
    <h2 id=""sharing"">Data sharing</h2>
    <p>{{CLIENT_LEGAL_NAME}} is authorised to share data with statutory, regulatory and government authorities; service providers engaged for business and operational purposes; and parties involved in facilitating services provided by the company. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm the recipients, purposes and legal basis for each category.]</p>
  </section>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""choice"">
    <h2 id=""choice"">Rights of the data principal</h2>
    <p>You may request correction, completion, updating and erasure of personal data processed with your consent, and withdraw consent at any time. To exercise these rights, contact the company at [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: insert the verified DPO or grievance email].</p>
    <p>Notwithstanding a request to withdraw consent, the company may retain data for periods prescribed by applicable law and for transactions initiated before withdrawal. For a complaint or grievance, contact [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: verified grievance contact]. An unresolved complaint may be escalated to the Data Protection Board in accordance with applicable law. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: verify the source form's 90-day escalation wording before publication.]</p>
  </section>

  <section class=""card callout"" aria-labelledby=""agreement"">
    <h2 id=""agreement"">Declaration</h2>
    <p>I declare that I have understood the points of this consent form and agree in my capacity as the data principal. The in-app acceptance checkbox replaces the paper signature, name and designation lines in the source form. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: approve electronic acceptance wording.]</p>
  </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
