IVE""}, ""ur"": {""name"": ""ایپ کا تعارف دکھائیں"", ""description"": ""لاگ اِن کرنے سے پہلے اختیاری تعارفی سلائیڈز دکھائیں۔"", ""translationStatus"": ""ACTIVE""}}, ""configuration"": {""version"": ""3"", ""appCodes"": [""RIDER""], ""translations"": {""en"": [{""key"": ""earn"", ""body"": ""Daily payouts, transparent incentives and a rental plan that fits how much you actually ride."", ""title"": ""Earn more,\nride cleaner"", ""highlights"": [""Same-day settlement"", ""No hidden deductions""]}, {""key"": ""vehicle"", ""body"": ""Live battery, range and health from the onboard IoT unit. Unlock and start your shift from the app."", ""title"": ""Your scooter,\nfully connected"", ""highlights"": [""Live telemetry"", ""One-tap start""]}, {""key"": ""support"", ""body"": ""Roadside assistance, service booking and a team lead who can see exactly what you see."", ""title"": ""Help that\nshows up"", ""highlights"": [""24x7 roadside help"", ""Service at your hub""]}]}, ""componentType"": ""INTRO_CAROUSEL""}}",916735fa23a573c3e74bfe72891e353a8dc800637dbfe93ddf286e5cd7b6465c,2026-10-15 19:55:31.283,2026-10-15 19:55:31.285
